sentence_before:
A typical change measure is
\begin{equation}
s_t=0.55p_t+0.25l_t+0.15h_t+0.05a_t,
\end{equation}
where $p_t$, $l_t$, $h_t$, and $a_t$ are measures of pixel change, Laplacian variance, histogram variance, and audio-event activity.

sentence_after:
A typical shift measure is
\begin{equation}
s_t=0.55p_t+0.25l_t+0.15h_t+0.05a_t,
\end{equation}
where $p_t$, $l_t$, $h_t$, and $a_t$ are measures of pixel change, Laplacian variance, histogram variance, and audio-event activity.
